WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.413
This supplied continuation is a proposal, not completed

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.535
activity. At thirty days, seek the responsible person’s

00:00:07.581 --> 00:00:10.321
permission for a bounded pilot using agreed safe

00:00:10.368 --> 00:00:14.698
inputs and retained observations. If permission is unavailable,

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:19.215
use the permitted fictional-review backup. At sixty days,

00:00:19.772 --> 00:00:22.303
compare the retained evidence with the agreed requirement

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:26.120
in a quality review. At ninety days, decide

00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:30.102
whether to continue, revise, stop, or consider wider

00:00:30.171 --> 00:00:35.187
use. Expansion requires relevant evidence and permission. Each

00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:40.562
stage names action, owner or collaborator, permission, boundary,

00:00:41.085 --> 00:00:45.949
evidence checkpoint, and next decision. No success, client,

00:00:46.135 --> 00:00:48.550
income, or certification is guaranteed.
